l-side-b-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-b-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-b.jpg 1312w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"23371\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/white-album-label-side-b/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-b.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1312,1312\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles (White Album) label, side 2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-b-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/white-album-label-side-c/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles (White Album) label, side 3\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-960x954.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c.jpg 1316w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"23372\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/white-album-label-side-c/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1316,1308\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles (White Album) label, side 3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-c-960x954.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/white-album-label-side-d/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles (White Album) label, side 4\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d.jpg 1312w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"23373\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/white-album-label-side-d/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1312,1312\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles (White Album) label, side 4\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-label-side-d-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>In the United States the <em>White Album</em> was released on <a href=\"/1968/11/25/us-lp-the-beatles-white-album/\">25 November 1968</a>. Its chart debut was at number 11, then it reached number two, before finally topping the charts on its third week of release. It spent nine weeks in the top spot, with a total of 155 weeks on the <em>Billboard</em> 200.</p><p>According to the Recording Industry Association of America, <em>The Beatles</em> is The Beatles&#8217; best-selling album at 19-times platinum, and is the 10th bestselling album of all time in the United States.</p><p>No singles were taken from the <em>White Album</em> at the time in the UK or US, although the standalone single <a href=\"/songs/hey-jude/\">&#8216;Hey Jude&#8217;</a>/<a href=\"/songs/revolution/\">&#8216;Revolution&#8217;</a> was recorded during the same sessions. In some countries <a href=\"/songs/ob-la-di-ob-la-da/\">&#8216;Ob-La-Di, Ob-La-Da&#8217;</a> was issued as a single, although this was a decision made by foreign record companies rather than The Beatles themselves.</p><blockquote><div>When we started, I don&#8217;t think we thought about whether the <em>White Album</em> would do as well as <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\"><em>Sgt Pepper</em></a> \u2013 I don&#8217;t think we ever really concerned ourselves with the previous record and how many it had sold. In the early Sixties, whoever had a hit single would try to make the next record sound as close to it as possible \u2013 but we always tried to make things different. Things were always different, anyway \u2013 in just a matter of months we&#8217;d changed in so many ways there was no chance of a new record ever being like the previous one.</p><p>After <em>Sgt Pepper</em>, the new album felt more like a band recording together. There were a lot of tracks where we just played live, and then there were a lot of tracks that we&#8217;d recorded and that would need finishing together. There was also a lot more individual stuff and, for the first time, people were accepting that it was individual.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">5</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/6/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">6</span></a></div>",
